{
  "name": "orienteering-any-order-and-a-missing-punch",
  "why": "`controls` with `in_order: false`, a score course: every control needs a punch and the order is free. Punching c3, c1, c2 is clean. Missing c2 is a mispunch and disqualifies. So is being read at c2 as `passed` rather than `punched` — in any order the kind asks for a punch at each control, where in order it asks only to be at each, in sequence.",
